{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02858","headline":"谒汉高庙 · 李百药","name":"谒汉高庙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"纂尧灵命啓，灭楚余闰终。\n飞名膺帝籙，沈迹韫神功。\n瑞气朝浮砀，祥符夜告丰。\n抑扬驾人杰，叱咤掩时雄。\n缔构三灵改，经纶五纬同。\n干戈革宇内，声教尽寰中。\n运谢年逾远，魂归道未穷。\n树碑留故邑，抗殿表祠宫。\n沐兰祈泗上，谒帝动深衷。\n英威肃如在，文物杳成空。\n竹皮聚寒径，枌社落霜丛。\n萧索阴云晚，长川起大风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李百药","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02858.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02858","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}